    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d499">

                <pb facs="0949" n="825" sameAs="frus:frus1881/pg825"/>

                <head>No. 495.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the
                            United States to the President of
                            Mexico.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1881-03-05"><hi rendition="#italic">March</hi> 5,
                        1881</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President of the United States sends to the President of the Republic of
                    Mexico the cordial congratulations of the government and <pb facs="0950" n="826"
                        xml:id="pg826"/> people of this country upon the successful completion, by
                    submarine cable, of connections between the telegraph systems of the two
                    countries.</p>
                <p>It must be a great satisfaction to your distinguished predecessor as well as
                    yourself to see so beneficent a fruit from the wise policy of your successive
                    administration.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
